### Complete Payment Workflow Test
### Run these tests in sequence to test the full payment lifecycle

### Step 1: Check if server is running
GET http://localhost:8000/health

###

### Step 2: Create a new payment
# @name createPayment
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscription_id": 1,
  "amount": 100.0,
  "gateway_id": "test_workflow_gw"
}

###

### Step 3: Approve the payment (use payment ID from step 2)
# Replace the payment ID below with the ID returned from createPayment
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/{{createPayment.response.body.id}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "approve-workflow-key-001"
}

###

### Step 4: Refund the approved payment
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/{{createPayment.response.body.id}}/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "refund-workflow-key-001"
}

###

### Step 5: Test idempotency - try refunding again with same key
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/{{createPayment.response.body.id}}/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "refund-workflow-key-001"
}

###

### Step 6: Try refunding with different key (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/{{createPayment.response.body.id}}/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "refund-workflow-key-002"
}

###

### Race Condition Testing
### Create a new payment for concurrent testing

# @name racePayment
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscription_id": 1,
  "amount": 50.0,
  "gateway_id": "race_test_gw"
}

###

### Test 1: First approval attempt
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/{{racePayment.response.body.id}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "race-test-key-same"
}

###

### Test 2: Second approval attempt with SAME key (should be idempotent)
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/{{racePayment.response.body.id}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "race-test-key-same"
}

###

### Test 3: Third approval attempt with DIFFERENT key (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/{{racePayment.response.body.id}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "race-test-key-different"
}

###

### Notification Testing

### Create a notification
# @name createNotification
POST http://localhost:8000/notifications/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "family_id": 1,
  "type": "payment_approved",
  "message": "Your payment has been successfully approved",
  "data": {
    "payment_id": "{{createPayment.response.body.id}}",
    "amount": 100.0,
    "gateway": "test_workflow_gw"
  }
}

###

### Get notifications for family
GET http://localhost:8000/notifications/family/1

###

### Error Testing

### Test invalid payment ID
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/99999/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "invalid-payment-test"
}

###

### Test missing idempotency key
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/1/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

###

### Test invalid subscription ID
POST http://localhost:8000/payments/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscription_id": 99999,
  "amount": 100.0,
  "gateway_id": "invalid_subscription_test"
}
